  "sourceTitle": "Introducing Claude Sonnet 5.5 on AWS",
  "sourceBodyHash": "8d77f7ab7606fc9972779a78ea5bbaeede8155c72a68d8fafe02f42b75176849",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-28T23:50:30.856618Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-28T23:51:51.869513Z",
  "totalBlocks": 24,
  "translatedBlocks": 24,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df0b68e04150a1bf",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们很高兴宣布 Claude Sonnet 5.5 在 Amazon Bedrock 和 Claude Platform on AWS 上可用。Claude Sonnet 5.5 是一个更智能、更高效的 Sonnet 模型，适用于专注编码和知识工作，在大多数工作中每任务成本更低，速度更快。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6db1116bb50dc42c",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 为您提供 Sonnet 5.5 的功能，同时通过区域数据驻留将您的数据保留在 AWS 基础设施内。它可与您团队已经使用的 AWS 控制配合使用，包括用于访问的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)、用于审计的 AWS CloudTrail、用于监控的 Amazon CloudWatch 以及 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails。使用情况将出现在您的 AWS 账单上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08e6d70a26e85dc7",
      "translationZh": "本文介绍了 Claude Sonnet 5.5 的改进、何时选择 Sonnet 的实用指南，以及如何在 Amazon Bedrock 上开始使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "59a8538c28569ba0",
      "translationZh": "Claude Sonnet 5.5 有何不同之处",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2c11268744a598c",
      "translationZh": "这些改进在明确范围的工作中尤为突出。无论开发者分配给它的是功能还是错误修复，Sonnet 5.5 都能完成工作并将结果与既定需求进行核对。它还能生成比 Sonnet 5 更精美的文档和可视化内容，包括单页文档、架构图和摘要幻灯片。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ff04bc264bf54e9",
      "translationZh": "凭借大多数工作中每任务成本更低的优势，Sonnet 5.5 非常适合持续运行或大规模运行的工作负载。在工程领域，这包括对警报的首次响应、代理的持续监控、SQL 生成、UI 和 UX 测试，以及在 IDE 中具有固定支出上限的快速编码代理。在企业层面，它支持范围明确的分析、简短的电子表格编辑以及面向大量用户的常规文档任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5f645af73d9d37b1",
      "translationZh": "将 Sonnet 5.5 与 Opus 5.5 配对以完成任务",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a474ad5179ba6760",
      "translationZh": "我们最近宣布了 Opus 5.5 的可用性。现在，借助 Sonnet 5.5，您可以结合两种工作：需要谨慎判断的决策，以及范围明确的任务。以下是您可以思考这些模型的方式：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b159930e0a41376",
      "translationZh": "Claude Opus 5.5 负责判断决策。在编码方面，这意味着发布调试、多 PR 特性堆叠、大型拉取请求的安全审查以及具有明确目标的代码迁移。除了代码，它还能处理最终产出为完成的电子表格、幻灯片或报告的长篇分析，以及财务研究和合同修订。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22ceadc0fdb48ed5",
      "translationZh": "Claude Sonnet 5.5 负责已经明确方法、只需快速执行的工作，相比 Opus 5.5 单任务成本更低，在大多数工作中速度更快。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "33e695c4d7a86e90",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Bedrock 上开始使用 Claude Sonnet 5.5",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "074a5871d31c8f7b",
      "translationZh": "要尝试 Sonnet 5.5，打开 Amazon Bedrock 控制台，进入 Test > Playground，并选择 Sonnet 5.5 作为模型。此后，您可以直接对其运行提示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e4d69f1c805bbc1",
      "translationZh": "图 1：在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台 Playground 中选择 Anthropic Claude 模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7ad068d517ea25e",
      "translationZh": "以编程方式，您可以通过 Anthropic SDK 使用 Anthropic Messages API 调用 bedrock-runtime 中的模型。您还可以通过 AWS Command Line Interface（AWS CLI）和 AWS SDK 在 bedrock-runtime 上使用 Invoke 和 Converse API。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b22eecb1e42c9c45",
      "translationZh": "您必须具备以下先决条件：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f2b168a098bc7db",
      "translationZh": "具有 Amazon Bedrock 访问权限的活跃 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a4ae8e129cdcf7a",
      "translationZh": "AWS CLI 已安装并配置。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6cb11aa854d906ac",
      "translationZh": "Boto3 已安装：pip install boto3 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1f05c067af740ae",
      "translationZh": "AWS 身份和访问管理（IAM）权限：bedrock:InvokeModel ， bedrock:InvokeModelWithResponseStream 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55629d584bda3810",
      "translationZh": "这是使用 AWS SDK for Python（Boto3）的 InvokeModel API 的快速示例：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8844d47e0448ae1",
      "translationZh": "您可以查看入门笔记本以获取更多示例。您可以通过 Amazon CloudWatch 和 AWS Cost Explorer 监控使用情况、性能和费用，以便随着需求增长扩展您的应用程序。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e9ff540c704973b",
      "translationZh": "Claude Sonnet 5.5 今日通过 Amazon Bedrock 的全球 CRIS（global.）推理配置文件在 bedrock-runtime 上提供。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d09c64e18568f06",
      "translationZh": "请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 文档以获取支持的 AWS 区域完整列表。有关定价信息，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 定价。它也可通过 AWS 上的 Claude Platform 在北美 获得。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77eab97078e42967",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台、AWS 上的 Claude Platform 或在 GitHub 上探索入门笔记本，尝试使用 Claude Sonnet 5.5。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
